# Flattop linux-firmware savedconfig: explicit paths relative to /lib/firmware.
# Apply using /usr/local/share/agentoo/docs/firmware.md; no globs or expansion.
# Reviewed against linux-firmware-20260622 and both 6.18.57 kernel boot logs.
# SOF, Intel microcode and regulatory data have separate package ownership.

# Raptor Lake-P i915: current ADLP DMC/GuC and TGL HuC plus driver fallbacks.
# The retained Xe alternative uses the same ADLP GuC/TGL HuC names.
i915/adlp_dmc.bin
i915/adlp_dmc_ver2_16.bin
i915/adlp_guc_70.bin
i915/adlp_guc_70.1.1.bin
i915/adlp_guc_69.0.3.bin
i915/tgl_huc.bin
i915/tgl_huc_7.9.3.bin

